# Environment variable template — CDC Lab Accounts & Asset Management System
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (git-ignored) and fill in real local values.
# Never commit real secrets. NFR-MNT-02 requires every variable the app reads
# to be listed here, even if it doesn't yet have real behavior wired to it.
#
# Phase 1 status: DATABASE_URL is read by the Prisma CLI (migrate/validate/
# format/db seed, via prisma.config.ts) for the development database. It is
# NOT automatically used by the application's own PrismaClient at runtime —
# Prisma 7 requires an explicit driver adapter (see prisma/client.ts), so
# runtime code always builds its own adapter from an explicitly-passed
# connection string. For the test database, see .env.test.example instead
# — TEST_DATABASE_URL is a completely separate variable, never a fallback
# for this one. Additional variables (Better Auth session secret/base URL,
# etc.) will be added here in the phase that actually configures each
# feature — see docs/PROJECT_PLAN.md — rather than guessed ahead of time.

# PostgreSQL connection string used by Prisma (development database).
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://cdc_dev:cdc_dev_password@localhost:5432/cdc_lab_accounts?schema=public"
